WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.257
Ranking functions should be chosen from the tie rule.

00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:07.852
If you need exactly two rows, row number is appropriate.

00:00:07.852 --> 00:00:13.197
If tied second-place employees should all be included, rank fits better.

00:00:13.197 --> 00:00:18.397
If you want compact rank levels without gaps, use dense rank.

00:00:18.397 --> 00:00:21.725
The business meaning of ties determines the function.
